=== Read the numbers here with care ===
The 9 November post describes the free allowance as "5 hours a day", and paid plans as 21 hours of the slow model with 7 hours of the fast one. Both were replaced by the hour table in the Discord FAQ on 22 November 2026, which is what the Cost section of this wiki uses. An announcement is a record of what was said that day, not the current price list.

''These posts were read from the two Discord channels on 24 November 2026; every line links to its own message, so the wording can be checked against the source.''

